    "到 系統設定 > 隱私權與安全性 > 區域網路 開啟 Chorus；若清單中沒有 Chorus，重新開機通常可以修復" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Go to System Settings > Privacy & Security > Local Network and enable Chorus; if Chorus is not listed, restarting your Mac usually fixes it"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "前往 系统设置 > 隐私与安全性 > 本地网络，开启 Chorus；若列表中没有 Chorus，重新启动通常可以修复"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "前置增益取自校正檔——AutoEq 已依整條曲線的峰值算好。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The preamp comes from the correction profile—AutoEq has already calculated it from the peak across the full curve."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "前置增益取自校正文件——AutoEq 已按整条曲线的峰值算好。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "前置增益由最大的正增益自動算出，用來抵銷提升、避免削波。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The preamp is calculated automatically from the largest positive gain to offset boosts and prevent clipping."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "前置增益由最大的正增益自动算出，用于抵消提升、避免削波。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "剛安裝完請稍候幾秒再重新整理；一直沒出現時重開機。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
