    "只在 macOS 原生處理不了時接手：螢幕喇叭（HDMI/DP）的音量鍵、沒有內建螢幕機器（如 Mac mini）的亮度鍵。其餘按鍵行為維持原生。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Take over only when macOS cannot handle it natively: volume keys for display speakers (HDMI/DP), and brightness keys on Macs without a built-in display (such as Mac mini). All other key behavior remains native."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "仅在 macOS 原生无法处理时接管：显示器扬声器（HDMI/DP）的音量键、没有内建屏幕的设备（如 Mac mini）的亮度键。其余按键行为保持原生。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "只在回送介面（127.0.0.1）上接受連線，需要 Bearer token。跨機控制一律走已配對的加密同步通道，不經這個介面。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Accepts connections only on the loopback interface (127.0.0.1) and requires a Bearer token. Cross-machine control always uses the encrypted sync channel between paired Macs, not this interface."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "仅在回送界面（127.0.0.1）上接受连接，需要 Bearer token。跨设备控制一律走已配对的加密同步通道，不经过这个界面。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "只看使用中" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Active Only"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "仅看使用中"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "可一次選多張（最多 %lld 張）：第一張作為配置圖背景與座標基準，其餘為分析用補充視角。拍不同照明情境（白天／夜晚／只開掛燈）並各自標註，分析會更準" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "variations" : {
            "plural" : {
              "one" : {
                "stringUnit" : {
                  "state" : "translated",
                  "value" : "Select up to %lld photo: The first is used as the layout background and coordinate reference; additional views are used for analysis. Capture and label different lighting scenarios (daytime/nighttime/desk lamp only) for more accurate analysis"
                }
              },
              "other" : {
                "stringUnit" : {
                  "state" : "translated",
                  "value" : "Select up to %lld photos: The first is used as the layout background and coordinate reference; additional views are used for analysis. Capture and label different lighting scenarios (daytime/nighttime/desk lamp only) for more accurate analysis"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "可一次选择多张（最多 %lld 张）：第一张作为配置图背景与坐标基准，其余为分析用补充视角。拍摄不同照明情境（白天／夜晚／仅开挂灯）并分别标注，分析会更准确"
          }
        }
      }
    },
