    "寫下這張照片的照明情境。照片是自動曝光的，畫面看不出絕對亮度，也分不出暗處是沒有燈還是燈關著——標註補的正是這段資訊" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Describe the lighting scenario in this photo. The photo is auto-exposed, so it does not show absolute brightness or whether dark areas have no light or lights turned off—the annotation provides that missing information."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "写下这张照片的照明情境。照片是自动曝光的，画面看不出绝对亮度，也无法分辨暗处是没有灯还是灯关着——标注补充的正是这段信息"
          }
        }
      }
    },
