    "左右切著聽，判斷這組等化有沒有讓聲音變好。切到「原聲」只是暫時不送出等化，設定不會被清掉。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Switch between left and right to judge whether this EQ improves the sound. Switching to \"Original\" only temporarily stops applying EQ; your settings are not cleared."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "左右切换试听，判断这组均衡有没有让声音变好。切到“原声”只是暂时不输出均衡，设置不会被清除。"
