    "把音量鍵／Touch Bar 交給它：設為預設輸出。自動模式下轉送目標會跟著使用中的螢幕走，螢幕關掉或拔掉就退回內建輸出——不會靜靜沒有聲音。選單列會把它與轉送目標併成一列。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Give it the volume keys/Touch Bar: set it as the default output. In Auto mode, the forwarding destination follows the display in use; if the display is turned off or disconnected, it falls back to the built-in output—audio will not silently disappear. The menu bar combines it and the forwarding destination into one row."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "把音量键／Touch Bar 交给它：设为默认输出。自动模式下转发目标会跟随正在使用的屏幕，屏幕关闭或拔掉就退回内建输出——不会悄悄没声音。菜单栏会将它与转发目标合并为一行。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
